  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Assembly-CSharp::UIAnimLab.Station
  Code: T3
  Title: Rotation
  Summary: Turns an element. On UI only Z is used.
  Watch: Box (the arrow shows which way is up)
  WatchObjects:
  - {fileID: 1027569992}
  HowTo: Play <b>Spin</b>, <b>Tilt</b>, then <b>Upright</b>.
  Expect: Spin turns one full turn clockwise and ends upright (a To beyond 360 really
    spins). Tilt leans it 25 degrees left. Upright puts it back.
  Needs: 1
  Style: 0
