  Title: Material Color
  Summary: Animates a colour on an element's own material copy.
  Watch: Glow Heart (Lab Glow shader), Face Text (TMP)
  WatchObjects:
  - {fileID: 848473809}
  - {fileID: 1526424937}
  HowTo: Play <b>Glow</b>, then <b>No Glow</b>, and <b>Face Colour</b>.
  Expect: Glow lights the heart up yellow and shifts the glow to teal. No Glow fades
    it off. Face Colour turns the letters orange, then white again.
