  m_Name: 
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Assembly-CSharp::UIAnimLab.Station
  Code: T14
  Title: Punch
  Summary: A jolt in one direction that springs back to where it started.
  Watch: Punch Pos, Punch Rot, Punch Scale
  WatchObjects:
  - {fileID: 309954556}
  - {fileID: 810879464}
  - {fileID: 1483486601}
  HowTo: Play <b>Punch All</b>. Then press Play again rapidly, several times.
  Expect: Each box jolts (up, a twist, bigger) and wobbles back. However fast Play
    is pressed, every box ends exactly where it started.
  Needs: 1
  Style: 0
  WikiPage: 
  Capture: 
