  m_Name: 
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Assembly-CSharp::UIAnimLab.Station
  Code: T10
  Title: Material Float
  Summary: Animates a float on an element's own copy of its material (UI Material
    Instance), on an Image and on a TextMeshPro text.
  Watch: Fill Bar (Lab Fill shader), Dilate Text (TMP's own shader)
  WatchObjects:
  - {fileID: 986707172}
  - {fileID: 536490054}
  HowTo: 'Play <b>Fill</b> and <b>Thicken</b>. Afterwards, look at <b>Assets/Shared/Materials/Lab
    Fill.mat</b>: its Progress should still read 1.'
  Expect: Fill sweeps the bar from empty to full, left to right. Thicken makes the
    letters bolder, then thin again. The material asset itself never changes.
  Needs: 5
  Style: 0
  WikiPage: 
  Capture: 
  Width: 620
  StageHeight: 260
